{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "grafana-table-signal-workbench",
  "title": "Build a table with filters, summaries, and gauges",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Start in **Dashboards** and build a standalone table with synthetic signals, readable rows, summary calculations, and numeric gauges."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Open **Dashboards** as the starting point for this lab."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "open-your-visualization-workspace",
      "title": "Open your visualization workspace",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/dashboards",
          "requirements": [],
          "id": "step-1",
          "tooltip": "Begin the independent build from this workspace.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Open **Dashboards** to begin.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "verify": "on-page:/dashboards"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have opened the workspace where you will create your practice dashboard."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Prepare **TestData** if it is missing; an existing source skips this setup, while creating one requires an administrator on Cloud or OSS."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "prepare-testdata-once",
      "title": "Prepare TestData once",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/connections/datasources/new",
          "requirements": [],
          "id": "step-2",
          "tooltip": "Prepare a synthetic source only when one is missing.",
          "skippable": true,
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Open **Add data source**."
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.AddDataSource.searchInput}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/connections/datasources"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "TestData",
          "id": "step-3",
          "tooltip": "No external credentials are needed for this practice data.",
          "skippable": true,
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Search for **TestData**."
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "body:has({grafana:pages.AddDataSource.searchInput}) button:text('TestData')",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/connections/datasources"
          ],
          "id": "step-4",
          "tooltip": "Create a local source of synthetic samples.",
          "skippable": true,
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **TestData** to create the data source.",
          "verify": "on-page:/connections/datasources/edit"
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "is-admin"
      ],
      "objectives": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have a synthetic source to practice with without external services or credentials."
    },
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "id": "practice-source-ready",
      "conditions": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ],
      "whenTrue": [
        {
          "type": "input",
          "id": "choose-practice-source",
          "inputType": "datasource",
          "variableName": "practiceSource",
          "datasourceFilter": "grafana-testdata-datasource",
          "prompt": "Select your TestData source; its name may differ in your organization.",
          "required": true,
          "requirements": [
            "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "whenFalse": []
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create a fresh dashboard, connect your selected source, and name a **Table** panel."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "build-the-table-panel",
      "title": "Build the Table panel",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/dashboard/new",
          "requirements": [],
          "id": "step-6",
          "tooltip": "Start with a fresh workspace for this lab.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Create a fresh dashboard for this lab.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "id": "prepare-panel-add-pane",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Sidebar.addButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "targetstate": "aria-expanded:true",
          "content": "Open **Add** to show the controls for creating a panel.",
          "tooltip": "Show the controls for adding dashboard elements."
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.newPanelButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-7",
          "tooltip": "Create space for the synthetic signals.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **Panel** to add a panel.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.configurePanelButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-8",
          "tooltip": "Adjust the query and presentation together.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **Edit visualization** to open the panel editor.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSourcePicker.inputV2}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "{{practiceSource}}",
          "id": "step-9",
          "tooltip": "Use the source selected in this guide.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "In the data source picker, select {{practiceSource}}.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "build-the-table-panel-viz",
          "content": "Choose the **Table** visualization.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Tab.title:Visualizations}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-10",
              "tooltip": "Choose how to display the returned samples.",
              "description": "Click **All visualizations**."
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PluginVisualization.item:Table}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-11",
              "tooltip": "Display samples as rows and columns.",
              "description": "Select **Table**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldInput:Title}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Signal workbench",
          "id": "step-12",
          "tooltip": "Make the finished panel easy to recognize.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Under **Panel options**, set **Title** to `Signal workbench`.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have a named panel connected to the source chosen for this sitting."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Generate one random walk from 50 within a range of 0 to 100 so you can focus on reading the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-bounded-practice-signals",
      "title": "Create bounded practice signals",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.TestData.QueryTab.min}:is(input)",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "0",
          "id": "step-13",
          "tooltip": "Keep the generated values nonnegative.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "In query **A**, set **Min** to `0`.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.TestData.QueryTab.max}:is(input)",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "100",
          "id": "step-14",
          "tooltip": "Keep the generated values within the practice range.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "In query **A**, set **Max** to `100`.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.TestData.QueryTab.startValue}:is(input)",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "50",
          "id": "step-15",
          "tooltip": "Begin halfway between the two bounds.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "In query **A**, set **Start value** to `50`.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.RefreshPicker.runButtonV2}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-17",
          "tooltip": "Load samples using the configured range.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Run the query to see your practice data.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have bounded synthetic samples for comparing display settings without interpreting them as real service health."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Keep timestamps visible, divide loaded rows into pages, and add column filters so you can inspect a large result without changing the query."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "make-a-dense-table-readable",
      "title": "Make a dense table readable",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Frozen columns} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "1",
          "id": "step-18",
          "tooltip": "Keep timestamps visible during horizontal scrolling.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Under **Table**, set **Frozen columns** to `1` to keep timestamps visible while scrolling horizontally.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Enable pagination} input[type='checkbox']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-22",
          "tooltip": "Split loaded rows into pages without limiting the query.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Under **Table**, enable **Enable pagination** to divide loaded rows into pages without limiting the query.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Column filter} input[type='checkbox']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-23",
          "tooltip": "Allow readers to narrow visible values by column.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Under **Table**, enable **Column filter** to filter individual columns.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Standard options Decimals} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "1",
          "id": "step-24",
          "tooltip": "Round the display without changing the underlying samples.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Under **Standard options**, set **Decimals** to `1` without changing the underlying values.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Pagination organizes the rows already returned by the query; it does not fetch fewer rows, and **Decimals** changes only their displayed precision."
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "id": "knowledge-check-4",
      "question": "What changes when pagination is enabled?",
      "completionMode": "correct-only",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "Loaded rows are divided into pages.",
          "correct": true,
          "hint": "Pagination controls presentation; it does not limit the query."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "text": "The data source returns fewer samples.",
          "correct": false,
          "hint": "Query limits and page layout are separate concerns."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Add footer calculations to compare the average sample (**Mean**) with the largest sample (**Max**); a high peak can be hidden by a moderate average."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "summarize-and-inspect-values",
      "title": "Compare average and peak values",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table footer Calculation} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Mean",
          "id": "step-25",
          "tooltip": "Summarize the average of the numeric samples.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Under **Table footer**, in **Calculation**, select **Mean** to show the average.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table footer Calculation} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Max",
          "id": "step-26",
          "tooltip": "Compare the peak against the average.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Under **Table footer**, in **Calculation**, also select **Max** to compare the peak with the average.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The footer summarizes the numeric samples while keeping the individual rows available for inspection."
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "id": "knowledge-check-5",
      "question": "Why keep both Mean and Max in the footer?",
      "completionMode": "correct-only",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "To compare the average sample with the peak.",
          "correct": true,
          "hint": "The two summaries describe different aspects of the numeric samples."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "text": "To replace every sample with one rounded value.",
          "correct": false,
          "hint": "Footer calculations summarize samples; decimal formatting affects display."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Apply an override to **A-series**, the numeric measurement column, so bar lengths compare its samples while **time** remains readable as timestamps."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "turn-one-numeric-column-into-gauges",
      "title": "Turn one numeric column into gauges",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "turn-one-numeric-column-into-gauges-matcher",
          "content": "Click **Add field override**, choose **Fields with name**, then select **A-series** to limit the change to measurements.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.button:Add field override}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-28",
              "tooltip": "Scope presentation changes to a specific field.",
              "description": "Click **Add field override**."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.select:Add field override} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "Fields with name",
              "id": "step-29",
              "tooltip": "Match the field using its displayed name.",
              "description": "Select **Fields with name**."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:panel-options-override-0 Fields with name} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "A-series",
              "id": "step-30",
              "tooltip": "Leave timestamps outside this numeric override.",
              "description": "Select **A-series** to apply the override only to the numeric column."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "turn-one-numeric-column-into-gauges-property",
          "content": "In the **A-series** override, click **Add override property** and select **Cell options > Cell type**.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.button:Add override property}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-31",
              "tooltip": "Choose which presentation setting to override.",
              "description": "Click **Add override property**."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.select:Add override property} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "Cell options > Cell type",
              "id": "step-32",
              "tooltip": "Configure how each matching value is rendered.",
              "description": "Select **Cell options > Cell type**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.OptionsGroup.group:panel-options-override-0} input[role='combobox']:not([id='panel-options-override-0-matcher'])",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Gauge",
          "id": "step-33",
          "tooltip": "Use bar length to help compare numeric samples.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "In the **A-series** override, set **Cell type** to **Gauge** to compare samples by bar length.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.OptionsGroup.group:panel-options-override-0} input[title='Gradient']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-34",
          "tooltip": "Use a continuous fill to compare lengths.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "In the **A-series** override, set **Gauge display mode** to **Gradient** for a continuous color fill.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.General.content}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-35",
          "tooltip": "A full bar marks the top of the loaded numeric range, not a capacity limit.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Compare the gauges with **Max** in the footer. With automatic bounds, this one-column table scales gauges from its smallest to largest loaded sample. If samples span 40–80, an 80 fills the gauge even though the generator allows 100.",
          "doIt": false,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The override changes only **A-series**; its longest gauge represents the largest loaded sample, not a measured capacity limit."
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "id": "knowledge-check-6",
      "question": "Does a full automatically scaled gauge mean 100% capacity?",
      "completionMode": "correct-only",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "No, it marks the largest loaded sample in this table, not a capacity limit.",
          "correct": true,
          "hint": "Automatic bounds come from loaded numeric values; they are not the generator bounds."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "text": "Yes, its length always measures capacity.",
          "correct": false,
          "hint": "The gauge bounds have not been defined as a capacity scale."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Save the finished dashboard under a recognizable name and inspect the retained table configuration."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "keep-your-finished-dashboard",
      "title": "Keep your finished dashboard",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.NavToolbar.editDashboard.backToDashboardButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-36",
          "tooltip": "Return with the panel configuration ready to save.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **Back** to return to the dashboard.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "keep-your-finished-dashboard-save",
          "content": "Save the dashboard as Table lab - Signal workbench.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.NavToolbar.editDashboard.saveButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-37",
              "tooltip": "Keep the next three actions together while the drawer is open.",
              "description": "Click **Save** to open the save drawer."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Drawer.DashboardSaveDrawer.saveAsTitleInput}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "Table lab - Signal workbench",
              "id": "step-38",
              "tooltip": "Give this workbench a reusable dashboard name.",
              "description": "Set **Title** to `Table lab - Signal workbench`."
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Drawer.DashboardSaveDrawer.saveButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-39",
              "tooltip": "Persist the finished configuration.",
              "description": "Click **Save**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DashboardSidebarSplitter.bodyContainer}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/d/",
            "has-dashboard-named:Table lab - Signal workbench"
          ],
          "id": "step-40",
          "tooltip": "Check the retained layout and numeric presentation together.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Inspect **Table lab - Signal workbench**: **Signal workbench** should show pagination, a frozen first column, column filters, and one decimal; its footer should contain **Mean** and **Max**, with gradient gauges in **A-series** and timestamps in **time**.",
          "doIt": false,
          "showMe": true,
          "verify": "has-dashboard-named:Table lab - Signal workbench"
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have saved a reusable table workbench combining readable rows, numeric gauges, and average and peak summaries."
    }
  ]
}
